ction design"},{"text":"Human factors"},{"text":"Accessibility"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the relationship:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Human","Perception","Cognition","Decision","Interaction","Computer System","Feedback","Human"]},{"type":"h","text":"UX Research Methods"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn both qualitative and quantitative methods."},{"type":"h","text":"Qualitative"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User interviews"},{"text":"Contextual inquiry"},{"text":"Observation"},{"text":"Focus groups"},{"text":"Diary studies"},{"text":"Think-aloud studies"},{"text":"Semi-structured interviews"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Quantitative"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Surveys"},{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"Task completion rates"},{"text":"Error rates"},{"text":"Time-on-task"},{"text":"SUS scores"},{"text":"Behavioural metrics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research Methodology"},{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the most important parts of becoming an HCI Researcher."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research questions"},{"text":"Hypothesis formulation"},{"text":"Literature review"},{"text":"Experimental design"},{"text":"Variables"},{"text":"Control groups"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Bias"},{"text":"Confounding variables"},{"text":"Statistical significance"},{"text":"Effect sizes"},{"text":"Reproducibility"},{"text":"Research ethics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Basic workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research Problem","Literature Review","Research Question","Hypothesis","Experiment Design","Participant Recruitment","Data Collection","Statistical Analysis","Interpretation","Research Paper"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Cognitive Computing + Human-AI Interaction"},{"type":"p","text":"Now integrate AI with HCI."},{"type":"h","text":"Machine Learning"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supervised learning"},{"text":"Unsupervised learning"},{"text":"Classification"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"Clustering"},{"text":"Feature engineering"},{"text":"Model evaluation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"scikit-learn"},{"text":"matplotlib"},{"text":"Jupyter"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Human-AI Interaction"},{"type":"p","text":"This should become a major competency."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Explainable AI"},{"text":"AI transparency"},{"text":"AI trust"},{"text":"Human oversight"},{"text":"Automation bias"},{"text":"Algorithmic decision-making"},{"text":"AI-assisted decision-making"},{"text":"Human-AI collaboration"},{"text":"AI feedback"},{"text":"AI uncertainty"},{"text":"AI mental models"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["User","AI System","Prediction / Recommendation","Explanation","User Evaluation","Human Decision","Outcome","Feedback to AI"]},{"type":"p","text":"Research questions can include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Does explanation improve trust?"},{"text":"When do users over-rely on AI?"},{"text":"How should uncertainty be communicated?"},{"text":"Does AI assistance improve task performance?"},{"text":"How do users form mental models of AI systems?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Interaction Design & Prototyping"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Figma"},{"text":"Wireframing"},{"text":"Prototyping"},{"text":"Interaction flows"},{"text":"Design systems"},{"text":"Responsive interfaces"},{"text":"Accessibility"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, the goal is not to become primarily a visual designer."},{"type":"p","text":"The goal is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Prototype","Experiment","Measure","Improve"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Research Specialisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose 1–2 advanced HCI research domains."},{"type":"h","text":"Human-AI Interaction"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI assistants"},{"text":"Explainable AI"},{"text":"Trust"},{"text":"Human oversight"},{"text":"AI agents"},{"text":"Collaborative AI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Multimodal Interaction"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Voice"},{"text":"Gesture"},{"text":"Vision"},{"text":"Touch"},{"text":"Text"},{"text":"Facial expressions"},{"text":"Multimodal interfaces"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Accessibility"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Assistive technologies"},{"text":"Screen readers"},{"text":"Accessible interfaces"},{"text":"Inclusive design"},{"text":"Cognitive accessibility"},{"text":"Motor accessibility"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Human-Robot Interaction"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Robot interfaces"},{"text":"Human-robot collaboration"},{"text":"Trust"},{"text":"Social robotics"},{"text":"Robot decision-making"}]},{"type":"h","text":"XR / Spatial Computing"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"VR"},{"text":"AR"},{"text":"MR"},{"text":"Spatial interfaces"},{"text":"3D interaction"},{"text":"Immersive environments"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Experimental Research Toolkit"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong HCI researcher should understand how to measure interaction."},{"type":"h","text":"Behavioural Metrics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Task completion time"},{"text":"Error rate"},{"text":"Success rate"},{"text":"Abandonment rate"},{"text":"Number of interactions"},{"text":"Task accuracy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"User Experience Metrics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SUS"},{"text":"NASA-TLX"},{"text":"User satisfaction"},{"text":"Cognitive workload"},{"text":"Trust"},{"text":"Perceived usefulness"},{"text":"Engagement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Physiological / Behavioural Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Where appropriate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Eye tracking"},{"text":"Gaze patterns"},{"text":"Facial expressions"},{"text":"Interaction logs"},{"text":"Response time"},{"text":"Mouse movement"},{"text":"Keystroke behaviour"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"The student should become comfortable analysing experimental data."},{"type":"h","text":"Stack"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research Data","Python / R","Data Cleaning","Exploratory Analysis","Statistical Testing","Visualisation","Interpretation","Research Findings"]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Descriptive statistics"},{"text":"Correlation"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"t-tests"},{"text":"ANOVA"},{"text":"Chi-square"},{"text":"Non-parametric tests"},{"text":"Confidence intervals"},{"text":"Effect sizes"},{"text":"Experimental power concepts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For research-heavy careers, R can also be useful alongside Python."},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Research Projects"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Human-AI Trust Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Build an AI decision-support system and investigate:"},{"type":"p","text":"How does explanation affect user trust in AI recommendations?"},{"type":"p","text":"Measure:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accuracy"},{"text":"Trust"},{"text":"Decision time"},{"text":"Over-reliance"},{"text":"User confidence"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Cognitive Load in AI Interfaces"},{"type":"p","text":"Compare two interface designs."},{"type":"p","text":"Measure:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Task completion"},{"text":"Errors"},{"text":"NASA-TLX"},{"text":"Completion time"},{"text":"User satisfaction"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Interface A","User Study","Performance + Cognitive Load"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Interface B","User Study","Performance + Cognitive Load","Statistical Test","Research Finding"]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Accessibility Evaluation Platform"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a tool that evaluates websites for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Keyboard accessibility"},{"text":"Screen-reader compatibility"},{"text":"Colour contrast"},{"text":"Navigation"},{"text":"Text readability"},{"text":"Interaction complexity"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then conduct user testing with appropriate accessibility considerations."},{"type":"h","text":"4. Multimodal AI Assistant"},{"type":"p","text":"Build an assistant using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Voice"},{"text":"Text"},{"text":"Vision"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Study whether multimodal interaction improves task completion compared with text-only interaction."},{"type":"h","text":"5. Human-Robot Interaction Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop a simulated robot interaction environment and investigate:"},{"type":"p","text":"How does robot explanation affect human trust and cooperation?"}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target internships such as:"},{"type":"h","text":"HCI / UX Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HCI Research Intern"},{"text":"UX Research Intern"},{"text":"User Research Intern"},{"text":"Interaction Design Research Intern"},{"text":"Usability Research Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human-AI Interaction Research Intern"},{"text":"AI Research Intern"},{"text":"Responsible AI Research Intern"},{"text":"Explainable AI Research Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Academic Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research Assistant"},{"text":"HCI Lab Intern"},{"text":"Cognitive Science Research Intern"},{"text":"Human Factors Research Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XR Research Intern"},{"text":"Human-Robot Interaction Intern"},{"text":"Conversational AI Research Intern"},{"text":"Accessibility Research Intern"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A university/research-lab internship can be particularly valuable for a student targeting a research career."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After B.Tech/B.E., possible roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HCI Research Assistant"},{"text":"UX Research Assistant"},{"text":"UX Researcher"}